    "Pinned term_word SPECIAL/NUMBERED NBRZW leaves BACK state unchanged; internal blank is consumed on following encode1 retreat, so X/Q survive adjacent to URI.",
    "Documented ManT recovery retains unknown/unsupported escape spelling at its own source position. Native formatter never prints that spelling.",
    "Existing refusal contract lower_table_cell_text decodes finalized native cell once; it does not replay Lk/UR annotations. Literal trailing blank from native empty UE input is retained in man raw cell projection; do not global-trim it.",
    "Private budget begin_candidate charges before clone; attempts0 refuses immediately; output_nodes1/output_bytes8 refuse after candidate generation; no speculative origin/decoration/diagnostic commit.",
    "All expected active target membership is based on original source macro membership, not candidate full JSON as an oracle. Current/before JSON is observation only.",
    "All20 exact pristine profiles preceded these assertions; stage evidence is retained outside the repository."
